onal'=>'a yàn láàyè','Never miss an important update'=>'Máṣe jẹ́ kí ìsọfúnni pàtàkì èyíkéyìí yọ́ ọ́ lọ́wọ́','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'A ti ṣafihan àṣàyàn yìí kí o má baà padanu ìfilọlẹ pàtàkì kankan kí o sì lè ràn wa lọwọ lati jẹ ki %s baamu diẹ sii pẹlu aaye ayelujara rẹ ti o si dara julọ ni ṣiṣe ohun ti o nilo rẹ fun.','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Ẹ ṣe pupọ fun mimu imudojuiwọn wa si %1$s v%2$s!','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Asẹ yẹn kii ṣe ọkan ninu awọn ede aaye yii.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ náà gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ lẹ́tà tàbí nọ́mbà kékeré 1 sí 8, bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan, bẹ́ẹ̀ sì ni kò gbọ́dọ̀ sọ orúkọ plugin náà.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" kii ṣe koodu ede. Lo agbegbe WordPress kan bi fr_FR tabi de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Ṣe àkọsílẹ o kere ju èdè kan.','That is more languages than one site can list.'=>'Iyẹn jẹ awọn ede to ju ti aaye kan le ṣe atokọ lọ.','About'=>'Nipa','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Tí a kọ́ nipasẹ Neil Lock, Alaga Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Àtẹ̀jáde %s','Tranzly website'=>'Wọ́bìsáìtì Tranzly','Zinn Digital® website'=>'oju opo wẹẹbù Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto naa.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Wo àwọn ètò Pro ati iye owó wọn','Languages'=>'Àwọn Èdè','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Èdè àkọkọ ni èdè tí a kọ ohun àkóópọ̀ rẹ sí. Àwọn alábèwò lè yí padà pẹ̀lú bálóòkì ìyípadà èdè.','(default)'=>'(àìṣàtúnṣe)','Remove'=>'Yọ kuro','Locale code'=>'Koodu agbegbe','For example fr_FR'=>'Fun apẹẹrẹ fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Oruko (ti ko dandan)','For example Français'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ Français','Add language'=>'Fi ede kun','Front-end output'=>'Ìṣajù ojú-òpó wẹ́bù','Class name prefix'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́ orúkọ kílàásì','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Gbogbo orúkọ kilásì tí plọ́gìnnì náà tẹ̀ sórí ojú ewé rẹ bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àfikún yìí, nítorí náà ojú ewé náà kò ní fi hàn pé èwo ni plọ́gìnnì tí ó kọ́ wọn. 1 sí 8 lẹ́tà kékeré tàbí nọ́mbà, bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan.','Beta updates'=>'Àwọn àfikún Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Ojula yii n gba awọn ẹya beta gẹgẹbi awọn imudojuiwọn.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Ojula yii n gba awọn ẹya iduroṣinṣin nikan.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Yi eyí padà lori oju-iwe Akawunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Awon eya beta ni a n se afihan won fun awon fifi sori Pro ti o ni iwe-ase ti o si ni isopọ mo iroyin won. Ni kete ti o ba ni isopọ, o le darapọ mọ lati oju-iwe Iroyin.','Save settings'=>'Fi àwọn ètò pamọ́','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Fi ede keji kun labẹ Tranzly ni akojọ aṣayan abojuto, yoo si han nibi.','Switcher'=>'Aṣọ̀yípadà','Accessible label'=>'Àwọn àmì tó ṣeé wọlé','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Aláyípadà èdè','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Awọn ọna aṣopọ si oju-iwe yii ni olukuluku awọn ede aaye naa. Ko ni han ohunkohun titi ti a o fi ṣe akoስተ awọn ede meji tabi ju bẹ lọ.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Èdè','block keywordswitcher'=>'Olutiraka','block keywordtranslation'=>'Ìtumọ̀']];